<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was quiet late Friday. There were no sales of slaughter steers or heifers confirmed at the close.</p>
<p>Inquiry and demand were light. Feedlots were very current. Last week's confirmed sales on 104,200 head including 17,300 head or about 17 percent previously contracted or formulated cattle.</p>
<p>Confirmed: none    last week:  none     last week:  26,900</p>
